	booktitle = {Third Reference Catalogue of Bright Galaxies.~Volume I: Explanations and references.~ Volume II: Data for galaxies between 0$^{h}$ and 12$^{h}$.~ Volume III: Data for galaxies between 12$^{h}$ and 24$^{h}$., by de Vaucouleurs, G.; de Vaucouleurs, A.; Corwin, H.~G., Jr.; Buta, R.~J.; Paturel, G.; Fouqu{\'e}, P..~Springer, New York, NY (USA), 1991, 2091 p., ISBN 0-387-97552-7, Price US$ 198.00. ISBN 3-540-97552-7, Price DM 448.00. ISBN 0-387-97549-7 (Vol. I), ISBN 0-387-97550-0 (Vol. II), ISBN 0-387-97551-9 (Vol. III).},
